<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8049] Limit the number of operation cycles in B+Tree</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8049</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When a tree is corrupted, a B+Tree operation may result in an infinite loop. We should limit the number of retries and fail if this limit is exceeded.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13147953">IGNITE-8049</key>
            <summary>Limit the number of operation cycles in B+Tree</summary>
